          "jcr:created": "Tue Mar 01 2022 21:33:52 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><b><span class=\"futura-bold\">B.</span> Fully slotted driver</b> allows for intra-operative screw re-engagements and removal.</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Mar 31 2022 14:02:27 GMT+0000",
