          "text": "<h3><b><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">22 biocomposite implant offerings to meet your procedural needs</span></b></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Biocomposite material: 85% Poly(L-Lactide) (PLLA) and 15% Beta-tricalcium phosphate (β-TCP) ​</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\">Leverages the osteoconductive properties of β-TCP, paired with the strength of PLLA<sup>2,3,4</sup></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\">Designed to promote bone healing and bony ingrowth at the implant site<sup>3,5,6,7</sup></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\">Clinically proven to be biocompatible over decades of clinical use<sup>5</sup></span></span><br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Sep 16 2024 16:55:19 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
